# Check every text file out with LF on every platform. Claude Code installs
# this plugin as a git checkout, and Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrote bin/govern.mjs to CRLF on Windows
# machines. The hook hashes its own file at session start and the gateway
# compares that hash against the first-seen hash for the version, so a
# CRLF checkout of an unmodified release attested as an edited hook.
# The hook now also normalizes line endings before hashing; this keeps the
# bytes on disk identical to the release in the first place.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
